  "details": "1Panel-dev CordysCRM before 1.9.2 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows authenticated users to list business titles by calling POST /field/source/business-title without permission checks. Users lacking CONTRACT_BUSINESS_TITLE_READ can retrieve organization invoicing entities, exposing tax identification numbers, bank account numbers, opening banks, registration addresses, and phone numbers.",
